cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "OSMViews"
abstract: >-
  OSMViews, a world-wide ranking of geographic locations by how much they are
  looked at on OpenStreetMap-based maps. This repository contains the
  data-processing pipeline and the web server; the ranking is published weekly
  as a Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFF.
type: software
authors:
